# Environment variable template for Lab 4 Homework 1 (Photo Gallery SPA).
#
# This frontend-only application does not require any environment variables:
# photo data and images are bundled locally, and there is no backend or API key.
#
# If a variable is added later, declare it here with a placeholder value only
# (Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code), copy this file
# to .env for local values, and never commit .env.
